<title>USA: United Technologies Corp Q4 net, shr rise.</title>
<headline>United Technologies Corp Q4 net, shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Millions of Dollars, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					   Quarter Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>					   December 31,  December 31,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>REVENUES:</p>
<p> Otis			     $1,509   $1,429   $5,595   $5,287</p>
<p> Carrier			   1,411    1,334    5,958    5,456</p>
<p> Automotive			  890	827    3,233    3,061</p>
<p> Pratt &amp; Whitney		 1,670    1,663    6,201    6,170</p>
<p> Flight Systems		    685	743    2,651    2,947</p>
<p>Corporate items and</p>
<p>  eliminations		    (27)     (29)    (126)    (119)</p>
<p> Total			     6,138    5,967   23,512   22,802</p>
